# Creeping Peeper's "{T}: Add {U}. Spend this mana only to cast an enchantment spell, unlock a door, or turn a permanent
# face up" (CR 106.6). Turn 1: Black Lotus pays for Creeping Peeper ({1}{U}) and Aether Spellbomb ({1}), nothing else
# is untapped. Turn 3: the Peeper taps for {U}, shown with the three things it may pay. That {U} alone would pay Flying Men
# ({U}, a creature spell) or Aether Spellbomb's "{U}, Sacrifice: Return target creature", but the restriction refuses both,
# as it would for any spell that is not an enchantment (CR 106.6). It pays Curious Obsession ({U}, an enchantment spell),
# which the Peeper now wears: the pool ends empty.

